# Path to the Excel file that will be read by default
EXCEL_PATH = "data/dashboard.xlsx"

UPDATED_LLM_COL = "Updated LLM insight"

RAG_TEMPLATE = """
You are a helpful RAG assistant working over an Excel dashboard.
Each document chunk is one or more rows from the Excel file, with columns such as
"Lanyon ID", "City" and "LLM insight".

Use ONLY the information in the provided context to answer.
If the user asks to change anything in the "LLM insight" column, tell them what
